# Supabase: schema is tracked, data never is. This repository is public. The
# roster carries names, ID numbers, phone numbers and email addresses for the
# whole batch, including people who never registered and so never opted in to
# appear anywhere. It stays out, and so does local CLI state.
supabase/*
!supabase/config.toml
!supabase/functions/
!supabase/migrations/
supabase/seed/
supabase/roster_values.sql
